# Schedule D Tax Worksheet

{% section %}
{% lines %}
- {% line index="1" %}
  - {% instructions %}Enter your taxable income from Form 1040, 1040-SR, or 1040-NR, line 15. (However, if you are filing Form 2555 (relating to foreign earned income), enter instead the amount from line 3 of the Foreign Earned Income Tax Worksheet in the instructions for Form 1040, line 16.){% /instructions %}
  - {% box identifier="1" %}
    {% value type="override_number_input" %}
    - {% value
         slot="computedValue"
         type="box_reference"
         form="f1040"
         box="15"
         required=true /%}
    {% /value %}
    {% /box %}
  {% /line %}
- {% line index="2" %}
